@ Index:  N-queens solver
@ Author: Calcman54, modified
@ Source: https://forum.swissmicros.com/viewtopic.php?p=34743#p34743
@ Tested: Single solution
@ Input:  X = 4
@ Output: 3,1,4,2
REGS
LBL ‘NQueens’
  STO ‘nn’
  4
  𝑥>? Y
    STOP
  R↓
  10
  𝑥<? Y
    STOP
  TICKS#
  STO ‘tt’
  0
  STO ‘xx’
  STO ‘cc’

  LBL A
    RCL ‘xx’
    RCL ‘nn’
    𝑥=? Y
      GTO ‘E’
    1
    STO+ ‘xx’
    RCL ‘nn’
    STO →‘xx’

    LBL B
      1
      STO+ ‘cc’
      RCL ‘xx’
      STO ‘yy’

      LBL C
        1
        STO- ‘yy’
        RCL ‘yy’
        𝑥=? 0.
          GTO A
        RCL →‘xx’
        RCL- →‘yy’
        𝑥=? 0.
          GTO D
        |𝑥|
        RCL ‘xx’
        RCL- ‘yy’
        𝑥≠? Y
          GTO C

        LBL D
          DSE →‘xx’
            GTO B
          DSE ‘xx’
            GTO D

          LBL ‘E’
            TICKS#
            RCL- ‘tt’
            10
            ÷
            STO ‘tt’
            0.001
            RCL× ‘nn’
            1
            +
            STO ‘xx’
            CLSTK
            RCL ‘tt’
            ‘s’
            +
            ‘n=’
            RCL ‘cc’
            +
            ‘’
            ‘→’
            GTO ‘G’

          LBL ‘F’
            ‘,’
            LBL ‘G’
              RCL →‘xx’
              +
              +
              ISG ‘xx’
                GTO ‘F’
  END
